    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's hard to even want to \"address\" it. what's the point in fixing something that doesn't even feel like it exists? if the \"me\" that's supposed to be doing the healing is already gone, then i'm just... i'm just a ghost. it feels more like i'm waiting for the rest of me to catch up and finish dissolving. it would be so much quieter if the void just took over completely.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
